      "instruction": "100% Cotton\nButton closure\nMachine Wash\nMATERIAL & FABRIC: Made in cotton, denim fabric skin-friendly, comfortable, elegant and fashionable design. Relaxed mobility without any restrictions.\nFEATURED & DESIGN: Featured with belted mid waist with beautiful bow tie, 2 mini pockets on both side, sense of layer catch eyes and easy to take small things, like key, accessories, flattering bell bottom with zipper closure, high quality denim fabric touch by soft. Good choice with crop tank tops, tshirts, tees, sandals, slippers, sneakers, comfortable and versatile to wear in summer, spring, autumn.\nFUNCTION & SIZING: Perfect for work office, office ladies, vacation, travel, street style, leisure, lounge, walking, fishing, camping, housewife. Available in blue color and in size (). To be more charming in the workplace and any leisure places.\nHand/Machine wash up to 30℃, turn jeans inside out, do not bleach, iron with low heat, do not dry clean, hang dry or line dry in the shadow, wash separately with different colors.",
